Alembic migrations for RateMyCampusEvents.

  alembic upgrade head       # apply everything
  alembic downgrade -1       # roll back one revision
  alembic current            # what the database is stamped at
  alembic upgrade head --sql # print the SQL without running it

The URL is read from app.core.config.DATABASE_URL; export the DATABASE_*
variables to point at a different database.
